OL,3,GNEWSA'Growing food here isn't
OL,4,Aprofitable, solar is'
OL,5,
OL,6,FDespite promising clean energy, solar
OL,7,Fhas become a dirty word in
OL,8,FLincolnshire, with at least 10 large
OL,9,Fprojects currently in the pipeline.
OL,10,FCritics point to a loss of productive
OL,11,Ffarmland but one farmer says he has no
OL,12,Fchoice but to turn to solar in order to
OL,13,Fsurvive.
OL,15,FJoe Ward slams a spade into the land he
OL,16,Fhopes will become Windsock Solar Farm.
OL,17,FThe sound of shovel on stone is like
OL,18,Fthe crack of a whip.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
