OL,3,GNEWSA'Growing food here isn't
OL,4,Aprofitable, solar is'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThis is not soft compost for roses in
OL,7,Fthe back garden, it is sandy soil
OL,8,Flittered with rocks bigger than tennis
OL,9,Fballs.
OL,11,F"The topsoil is very shallow and stony,
OL,12,Fand the soil texture is coarse," he
OL,13,Ftells me.
